Before producing the final document, perform a completeness check.

Verify that you have reviewed:

* All sidebar links
* All user-facing routes
* All controllers
* All controller actions
* All create/edit forms
* All detail pages
* All models
* All relevant foreign keys
* All validations
* All permissions
* All status/state actions
* All search/filter/sort functions
* All uploads
* All modals/dropdowns
* All dashboard functionality
* All profile/account functionality
* All significant cross-module workflows

Compare the final UAT cases against the feature inventory.

If a discovered feature has no corresponding UAT scenario, add one before finishing.

